                <l xml:id="m-ce0571d8-e464-47f2-b9fa-f3d33a3815e2" facs="#m-31207030-832d-4625-8996-a47a6fc575ba" label="ambiguous">883</l><l xml:id="m-4eb07572-eb9e-43ec-be4f-6e2c81ae38d5" facs="#m-e22d34cc-42ac-4544-bc71-bcd0187dc516" label="text-like">At Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-2f4594a8-84d6-4678-8d59-f04b903c8bc0" facs="#m-5f87f032-a6a4-42cf-9e84-e78666ed433e" label="lyrics-like">tis spi-ri-tus ve-heméntis, u-bi é-rant se-dén-tes, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-5538248e-168e-4055-8801-2b4483793187" facs="#m-b82125bd-8434-4d7a-8c7c-c02732263df1" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia: et replé-ti sunt ómnes Spf-ri-tu Sáncto, loquén¬</l><l xml:id="m-b6927ce6-a1b6-497f-b41f-46f1dbf913f4" facs="#m-0a32a3d3-7b5d-49d5-8c7a-4dca7649024c" label="lyrics-like">tes magná¬ li- a Dé¬ i,</l><l xml:id="m-50beeed1-396a-4897-aea8-587648c71a29" facs="#m-e78ac201-9386-4505-a89f-0a9ce120e5fe" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú- ia,</l><l xml:id="m-8256b798-69e1-41c8-9392-eba021cdf8e5" facs="#m-253c6bab-ed5c-48aa-b626-c28c162d6d8b" label="lyrics-like">alle- lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-3f5d8f80-6ff4-410f-a817-eae9b94769ca" facs="#m-1a0430eb-678e-4dbf-8a50-3571fc44d1c0" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-5ca12905-2766-488c-87db-8198d23d0b33" facs="#m-f2989760-d959-4e44-ace9-6ff9130bf2a8" label="lyrics-like">NAncti Spiritus, Dómine, corda !Per Dóminum... in unitáte ejúsdem</l><l xml:id="m-e429b485-430f-4d40-9b24-cf789051ed5f" facs="#m-c7f32f4c-a2f4-4131-96ae-5a6cfbea9479" label="lyrics-like">O nostra mundet infúsio: et sui</l><l xml:id="m-62fa8468-7daf-4901-8960-e1381f029c88" facs="#m-b83c37aa-763b-462b-8e91-7596de990be3" label="ambiguous">Spiritus.</l><l xml:id="m-52482c17-66a1-4b2f-aa03-d18dab517845" facs="#m-7fa16938-67ab-46c6-9111-b6934db59942" label="lyrics-like">roris intima aspersióne foecúndet.</l><l xml:id="m-9377cfd3-4e55-4d9b-9861-f52e99d8fc2e" facs="#m-e4678f1c-a515-4e35-8843-53e1bfcc6f5d" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-87e0c011-3c48-4286-bd2d-393445882a87" facs="#m-05fe2b2a-b9f1-41fa-8fda-0e74f9053195" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Repléti sunt ómnes. p. 884.</l><l xml:id="m-9eec49b4-fa66-4030-a888-0d5d991c28af" facs="#m-2d62301f-8b31-4bfa-9216-5b33517d922d" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-8536732b-d9c9-4d41-87fe-01935acc968e" facs="#m-9ae746ca-35cf-4563-8bdd-e86e4087caad" label="ambiguous">Act. 2.</l><l xml:id="m-145af836-cde4-48ce-8b7b-acb8e21ed8bc" facs="#m-4f56fda9-044b-4aa1-9e3c-17259dc769c6" label="lyrics-like">JActa autem hac voce, convénit! est:*quóniam audiébat unusquis¬</l><l xml:id="m-135caf3f-fa43-448a-b0ae-897ebac973f0" facs="#m-ac2bb5eb-721c-4f67-bdb4-df070212451a" label="lyrics-like">multitúdo, t et mente confúsa! que lingua sua illos loquéntes.</l><l xml:id="m-e39aee32-9df6-4e5c-af0a-d1917c1b909b" facs="#m-093b6688-6bfe-45e9-9401-c59b76b3c8de" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-150c7e95-1082-4d82-9571-e0872d992940" facs="#m-fe91522b-1663-4a55-9701-414e29979fde" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-2cb371c0-e93a-43a7-9874-939449af665c" facs="#m-2d68aa4a-7771-4e18-becd-79d317b95cfd" label="lyrics-like">Pi-ri-tus Parácli-tus:“Alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia. V. Docé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f38216a7-bc98-4f03-97ef-223455e11bac" facs="#m-8a0bd694-9158-4861-b56e-24f78f18bd38" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-c475c5f5-5361-4e70-9253-9bb0a509d848" facs="#m-31bf6d5b-2d43-41a6-8b67-54330ef1efb8" label="lyrics-like">bit vos ómni-a. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-c195fe96-7ee9-4007-bb34-74c02bc3b0a8" facs="#m-b7f17eae-0819-444f-8067-2a99498cabc1" label="lyrics-like">V. Repléti sunt ómnes Spiritu Sáncto, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-dadc6ce5-6771-40ba-a915-3d5f1a4df3a4" facs="#m-2db18ad3-df30-47e3-83c7-8569d9307c69" label="lyrics-like">F. Et coepérunt lóqui, alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-96563f40-c76c-476a-85d4-3eb43da5bd2d" facs="#m-c6045adb-8ba9-48ce-b28c-0410ee96cb40" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-881c81cb-32fc-4626-815d-5247313d4134" facs="#m-708c197b-422e-48d2-b99b-acc94adc2e0b" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Loquebántur. p. 884.</l><l xml:id="m-edcb3860-b68a-48a7-b09f-fe3472a156bc" facs="#m-5ca323d7-62a1-4a47-b059-2916d85819e9" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-e409ee4e-683b-4d05-9b60-9fb9bb9a7417" facs="#m-00c1f710-265c-48c6-a806-30dcf96f599f" label="ambiguous">Acts. 2. b.</l><l xml:id="m-9c1ccb6b-918b-4da9-ad5f-fb5f8c3247bb" facs="#m-4eae2ac5-c081-47b2-b9e7-c78a0e232051" label="lyrics-like">(Udaéi quoque, et Prosélyti, Cre- eos loquéntes nostris linguis “ ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-3d12eb6d-3e34-46b1-86b2-154304953481" facs="#m-fd69ff11-2f0d-4e0c-9910-56ee6e0fae65" label="lyrics-like">CA tes, et Arabes: t audivimus gnália Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-2a54a3dc-b1f1-4289-8faf-1378e8f47b56" facs="#m-37cfe9b6-e6f9-4d87-a008-657cd34c7151" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-d29c775f-e7a4-48b0-b68b-a4751227dbb6" facs="#m-190d835c-1110-4703-89c2-1a1afebca858" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-935c6d06-a714-42e2-8b29-b9adc8338d38" facs="#m-1dc8d5ee-b605-44f2-9dc1-fc880c37bc40" label="ambiguous">R</l><l xml:id="m-e22d2e71-8d5c-4e7f-a31a-072eeb65971c" facs="#m-c37b2a70-cfd7-4f9d-afa9-48753492f166" label="lyrics-like">Eplé-ti sunt ómnes Spí-ri-tu Sáncto: “Alle-lú-ia,</l></lg>
